acceptance_criteria: Inventory all six authored executable TypeScript source files and prove which the current gate omits; coverage gate fails when any authored executable source is unmeasured; measure statements lines branches functions at 100% per included file with real tests; retain docstring and release gate parity without artificial exclusions or duplicated tests.
